+# K16 t=5 replay gate
+
+Date: 2026-09-03.
+
+## Verdict
+
+VERDICT: **CONFIRMED**, fixed `t=5`, for the gauged K=16 order-chart
+necessary superset of `(64,44;61;3; J=c*gamma)` on `c != 0`.
+
+The charged `t=5` heuristic terminal and Grok exact `nfmodStd` certificate
+were replayed on this seat.  The regenerated Q-pivots, A-pivots, terminal TSV,
+and charged Singular drivers are byte-identical to `box/k16t56-20260903/`.
+The exact `nfmodStd` job returns `[1]`; a second exact `nfmodStd` run with the
+terminal variables reversed also returns `[1]`; the three modular `std` runs
+return `[1]`.
+
+No exit-price assertion is made here; no `charge_basis=...` line is due.
+
+## Custody
