+were replayed on this seat.  The regenerated Q-pivots, A-pivots, terminal TSV,
+and charged Singular drivers are byte-identical to `box/k16t56-20260903/`.
+The exact `nfmodStd` job returns `[1]`; a second exact `nfmodStd` run with the
+terminal variables reversed also returns `[1]`; the three modular `std` runs
